Do not add quality refinements until TEST B establishes whether the altered world can persist.

If TEST B succeeds but camera registration is loose, use a precomputed CLEAN-PLATE version of the source video as `optional_guiding_latents`, not the photographed plate containing the actor. Sweep low guide strengths first: 0.20, 0.35, 0.50. Keep normalizing/AdaIN off initially.

Only after the structural edit works:
- A/B the diffusion decoder `ltx-2.5-video-vae-bf16.safetensors` against the Conv decoder;
- increase resolution;
- add official 2.5 DFR/spatial refinement when a verified path is available.
